@startuml
title Metro Parking App — frontend data flow
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor Commuter

package "React application" {
  [OverviewPage] as Overview
  [FacilityPage] as Facility
  [SearchBar] as Search
  [FacilityCard] as Card
  [FacilityHistoryChart] as Chart
  [TanStack Query] as Query
  [parkingApi] as ApiAdapter
  [Generated OpenAPI types] as Types
}

cloud "Metro Parking Web Service\n/api/v1/parking" as Backend
database "Query cache" as Cache

Commuter --> Overview
Commuter --> Facility
Overview --> Search
Overview --> Card
Facility --> Chart
Overview --> Query : facility list
Facility --> Query : live sample + history
Query <--> Cache : two-minute refresh policy
Query --> ApiAdapter
ApiAdapter ..> Types : request / response shapes
ApiAdapter --> Backend : list, /live, /history
Backend --> ApiAdapter : source time in epoch ms\nhistory tuple points

note bottom of Backend
  Backend rotates current-day ingestion
  across enabled facilities. The frontend
  labels sample time as Sydney local time.
end note
@enduml
